{"src":"en","tgt":"ur","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":163000,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"ur","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":7705.493969,"text":"If you have watched the movie National Treasure, you may think a treasure map was written on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"text","t":8840.093608000001,"text":"اگر آپ نے فلم National Treasure دیکھی ہے، تو آپ شاید سوچیں کہ Declaration of Independence کی پشت پر ایک خزانے کا نقشہ لکھا گیا تھا۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":9019.538609000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":190,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9024.150431,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9029.348522,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9034.611302000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9039.857292,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9045.361428,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9046.534778000001,"samples":14321,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"input","t":13876.448598,"text":"The hot chocolate is up to Belgian standards. Fruit juices are pricey, but after a while, you'll be able to taste the sweetness."},{"kind":"text","t":14984.357994000002,"text":"ہاٹ چاکلیٹ بیلجیم کے معیار کے مطابق ہے۔ پھلوں کے جوس مہنگے ہوتے ہیں، لیکن کچھ دیر بعد، آپ کو ان کی مٹھاس کا احساس ہونے لگے گا۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":15159.622377,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15164.783308000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":15170.209775,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15176.088674999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15180.873773,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":15186.051535000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15191.308985,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":15191.757497000002,"samples":501,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":22221.225856,"text":"However, that is not true. Although there is something written on the back of the document, it is not a treasure map."},{"kind":"text","t":23055.363133000003,"text":"تاہم، یہ سچ نہیں ہے۔ اگرچہ دستاویز کی پشت پر کچھ لکھا ہوا ہے، لیکن یہ خزانے کا نقشہ نہیں ہے۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":23192.515287000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23195.639074000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23199.117514,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":23202.342959,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23205.575344,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23207.940094,"samples":13095,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":430},{"kind":"input","t":29990.876258,"text":"You may also wish to consult the advice of governments other than your own, but their advice is designed for their citizens."},{"kind":"text","t":31294.221161999998,"text":"آپ اپنی حکومت کے علاوہ دیگر حکومتوں کے مشورے سے بھی رجوع کر سکتے ہیں، لیکن ان کے مشورے ان کے اپنے شہریوں کے لیے بنائے گئے ہیں۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":31458.953725000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31463.878231,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31469.109351000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31474.361351000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31479.623531,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":31484.472748000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31488.486330000003,"samples":27139,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"input","t":41296.641383999995,"text":"Hong Kong Island gives the territory of Hong Kong its name and is a place that many tourists regard as the main focus."},{"kind":"text","t":42636.563861999995,"text":"ہانگ کانگ آئی لینڈ ہی ہانگ کانگ کے علاقے کو اس کا نام دیتا ہے اور یہ ایک ایسی جگہ ہے جسے بہت سے سیاح مرکزی توجہ کا مرکز سمجھتے ہیں۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":42805.455314,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42810.39387,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42815.766528,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42820.531945999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42825.978102999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42831.187494,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42836.507592999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42836.946346,"samples":4681,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"input","t":49104.254156999996,"text":"Anyone who's going to drive at hot latitudes or over mountain passes should consider the possibility of snow, ice, or free"},{"kind":"text","t":50476.511902,"text":"جو کوئی بھی گرم عرض بلدوں میں یا پہاڑی دروں پر گاڑی چلانے جا رہا ہے، اسے برف، برفانی تہہ یا جمنے کے امکان پر غور کرنا چاہیے۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":50642.205739,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50647.377710999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50652.724238999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50658.170205999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50663.208119999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50668.097276,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50669.897764999994,"samples":19894,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":720},{"kind":"input","t":58792.513221999994,"text":"Segregation and recombination shuffle variation back and forth between the two pools."},{"kind":"text","t":59544.72216,"text":"علیحدگی اور ملاپ تبدیلی کو دونوں پولز کے درمیان آگے پیچھے منتقل کرتے رہتے ہیں۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":59665.612561999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59670.944190999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59676.525515999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59682.045412,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59682.779119,"samples":7411,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":190},{"kind":"input","t":61184.323973,"text":"with each generation."},{"kind":"text","t":61429.305474,"text":"ہر نسل کے ساتھ۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":61463.521888999996,"samples":30650,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1170},{"kind":"input","t":67124.46110900001,"text":"The term bug is used by entomologists in a formal sense for this group of insects."},{"kind":"text","t":68512.906447,"text":"حشرات پologist (entomologists) اس گروپ کے کیڑوں کے لیے 'بگ' (bug) کی اصطلاح باقاعدہ طور پر استعمال کرتے ہیں۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":68655.46099,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":460,"off":1100},{"kind":"audio","t":68660.44795500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68665.767523,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68671.11720200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68676.34134300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68681.45921500001,"samples":30371,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1150},{"kind":"input","t":74699.245484,"text":"First, most riders wearing riding boots with a heel and a smooth, quite narrow sole."},{"kind":"text","t":75827.065728,"text":"پہلے، زیادہ تر سوار ایسے رائڈنگ بوٹس پہنتے تھے جن کی ایڑی ہو اور تلہ ہموار اور کافی تنگ ہو۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":75932.898709,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":190,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75938.015681,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75943.07445500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75948.19373700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75953.57183500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75953.89937900001,"samples":5572,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":110},{"kind":"input","t":83919.291155,"text":"The commission was Martelli's response to widespread anti-regime protests that started in October."},{"kind":"text","t":85053.146156,"text":"کمیشن اکتوبر میں شروع ہونے والے حکومت مخالف بڑے پیمانے پر ہونے والے احتجاجی مظاہروں کے جواب میں مارٹیلی کا ردعمل تھا۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":85190.83067200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":190,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85196.066292,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85201.415011,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85206.911857,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85212.265365,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85217.721582,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85221.16373300001,"samples":21566,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":790},{"kind":"input","t":91142.53970000001,"text":"Fire rescue crews eventually doused the fire by 11.35pm."},{"kind":"text","t":92125.11371800001,"text":"فائر ریسکیو ٹیموں نے آخر کار رات 11:35 بجے تک آگ بجھا دی۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":92205.081151,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":300,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92206.56041600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92208.035,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92209.423047,"samples":29870,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1110},{"kind":"input","t":97371.94425,"text":"The tensioning storm of the Atlantic hurricane season, Subtropic Storm Jerry,"},{"kind":"text","t":98661.396831,"text":"اٹلانٹک ہریکین سیزن کا تناؤ بڑھانے والا طوفان، سب ٹروپک اسٹورم جیری،"},{"kind":"audio","t":98745.323756,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":310,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98746.55577400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98748.01455,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98749.408356,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98749.708361,"samples":6018,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":140},{"kind":"input","t":100225.478705,"text":"formed in the Atlantic Ocean today."},{"kind":"text","t":100580.263469,"text":"آج بحر Atlantic میں بن گیا۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":100621.06350100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100623.939572,"samples":18501,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":640},{"kind":"input","t":107229.363872,"text":"It has brought us to train the car and many other transportation devices."},{"kind":"text","t":108037.384535,"text":"اس نے ہمیں کار اور نقل و حمل کے کئی دیگر آلات کی تربیت کرنے پر مجبور کر دیا ہے۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":108133.18793700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108138.34916900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108143.83335500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108149.315871,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108150.55134,"samples":9919,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":280},{"kind":"input","t":116620.86357100001,"text":"It's renowned for being an epicenter of luxury began in about 400 AD and lasted up a"},{"kind":"text","t":117790.44496200001,"text":"یہ عیش و عشرت کے مرکز ہونے کے لیے مشہور ہے جس کا آغاز تقریباً 400 عیسوی میں ہوا اور یہ جاری رہا۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":117902.18201100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117907.26068400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117912.497365,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117917.941922,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117922.834378,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117923.798251,"samples":8359,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":240},{"kind":"input","t":120744.49020900001,"text":"until about 1100 A.D."},{"kind":"text","t":121343.728292,"text":"تقریباً 1100 عیسوی تک۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":121392.02736600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":510,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121394.816349,"samples":18780,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":590},{"kind":"input","t":127071.222624,"text":"The surface of the moon is made of rocks and dust. The outer layer of the moon is called the crust."},{"kind":"text","t":127618.036724,"text":"چاند کی سطح چٹانوں اور دھول سے بنی ہے۔ چاند کی بیرونی تہہ کو کرسٹ کہا جاتا ہے۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":127727.70108900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127732.95220900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127738.62163200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127744.229256,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127744.831426,"samples":7133,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":180},{"kind":"input","t":134216.07950999998,"text":"The U.S. Corps of Engineers estimated that six inches of rainfall could breach the previously damaged"},{"kind":"text","t":135202.513193,"text":"امریکی کور آف انجینئرز نے تخمینہ لگایا کہ چھ انچ بارش پہلے سے क्षतिग्रस्त حصے کو توڑ سکتی ہے۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":135338.640575,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":440,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":135343.73428799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135349.108756,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135354.386146,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135359.788443,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135362.30232,"samples":17554,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":580},{"kind":"input","t":141188.888458,"text":"In particular, it is claimed that one can detect whether a person is lying by interpreting micro-expressions correctly."},{"kind":"text","t":142843.538714,"text":"خاص طور پر، یہ دعویٰ کیا جاتا ہے کہ مائیکرو ایکسپریشنز (micro-expressions) کی درست تشریح کر کے یہ معلوم کیا جا سکتا ہے کہ آیا کوئی شخص جھوٹ بول رہا ہے۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":143017.926362,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143022.948867,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143028.237876,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143033.314119,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143038.47878099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":143043.70999099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143047.837511,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143048.13611599998,"samples":5795,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":100},{"kind":"input","t":147236.929889,"text":"Do not deface the site by marking or scratching graffiti into structure."},{"kind":"text","t":148023.383461,"text":"اس جگہ کی ساخت پر گرافٹی لکھ کر یا خراشیں ڈال کر اسے بدصورت نہ کریں۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":148120.465641,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148125.403997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148130.82409399998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148135.092151,"samples":26526,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":970},{"kind":"input","t":154877.690595,"text":"The tiger's roar is not like the full-voiced roar of a lion, but more like a sentence of snarly, shouted words."},{"kind":"text","t":156566.56225599998,"text":"شیر کی دھاڑ شیرِ بنگال کی پوری آواز والی دھاڑ جیسی نہیں ہوتی، بلکہ یہ غراہٹ بھرے چیخے ہوئے الفاظ کے ایک جملے کی طرح ہوتی ہے۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":156736.858094,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156741.835219,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156747.13446899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156752.15394299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156757.58643,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156762.988308,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156767.351043,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156767.658918,"samples":5516,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":130},{"kind":"input","t":161918.166956,"text":"20th century research has shown that there are two pools of genetic variation, hidden and expressed."},{"kind":"text","t":163044.935409,"text":"بیسویں صدی کی تحقیق نے یہ ظاہر کیا ہے کہ جینیاتی تغیر کے دو ذخیرے ہوتے ہیں، پوشیدہ اور ظاہر شدہ۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":163203.10070399998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":163208.210967,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163213.543896,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163218.769516,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163224.064036,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163224.32438099998,"samples":2786,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":173304.474265,"code":1005}]}